# TypeScript modules

- Relative imports end in `.js` (emit/NodeNext), including `./foo.js` for `foo.ts`.
- Prefer explicit null checks over non-null assertions (`!`) in new/edited code.
- Match existing Biome formatting; use `bun run lint:check` (non-mutating) in agents; `bun run lint`/`format` only when asked to fix style.
- Server: `src/` Bun/Express. Web: `web/` React 19 + Vite. Do not mix package managers.
- Avoid drive-by refactors unrelated to the task.
